OL,3,GNEWSASchools face tough choices as
OL,4,Abirth rate falls
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Yeadon Primary School in Leeds, head
OL,7,Fteacher Dawn Lawry has a simple way of
OL,8,Fexplaining the challenge it faces.
OL,10,F"We have 30 children coming into
OL,11,Freception, but we have 60 going out in
OL,12,FYear 6 so it doesn't take a genius to
OL,13,Fdo the maths," she says.
OL,15,F"Those numbers are dropping and by
OL,16,FJanuary 2029 we will be a one-form
OL,17,Fentry primary school."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
