OL,3,GNEWSASchools face tough choices as
OL,4,Abirth rate falls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school was created in September
OL,7,Fwhen Westfield Infants and Westfield
OL,8,FJuniors merged, following a financial
OL,9,Fcrisis that left the two schools facing
OL,10,Fa combined projected deficit of #1.6m.
